OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FMainly dry but rather cloudy in
OL,6,Fthe morning with just a few light
OL,7,Fshowers, these mainly across Argyll.
OL,8,FBecoming mainly dry through the
OL,9,Fafternoon with sunny spells.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FAny remaining showers will
OL,12,Fclear to leave a dry evening with some
OL,13,Flate sunny spells. The rest of the
OL,14,Fnight will then remain dry with clear
OL,15,Fperiods.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA dry and bright morning with
OL,18,Fsunny intervals. Turning cloudier
OL,19,Fthrough the afternoon, with the chance
OL,20,Fof a few spots of rain during the
OL,21,Fevening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
