OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FRain
OL,6,Fspreads northwards on Monday, at times
OL,7,Fheavy and persistent. Further spells
OL,8,Fof rain or showers are likely on
OL,9,FTuesday and Wednesday.
